  <h2>What we do not know</h2>
  <p>The meta-analyses mix many exercises and populations, and most trials last under four months. Few test the bench press on its own, and none that we found compared benching daily with benching three times a week for a strength goal. If you are not sure, start with two or three days and judge it by your own log over 8 to 12 weeks.</p>
